    skos:definition "Collection of materials belonging to the category of Metamorphic Rocks by Composition, characterized by including rocks derived from a pre-existing rock, through mineralogical, chemical or structural changes, essentially in solid state, in response to physicochemical variations of pressure and temperature, classified according to their resulting mineralogical composition."@en,
