<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/absarokita> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Basaltic rock composed of olivine and clinopyroxene phenocrysts in a matrix of calcic plagioclase (labradorite), alkali feldspar (sanidine), olivine and, occasionally, leucite. It is similar to shoshonite but lacks plagioclase phenocrysts"@en,
        "Roca basáltica compuesta por fenocristales de olivino y clinopiroxeno en una matriz de plagioclasa cálcica labradorita, feldespato alcalino sanidina, olivino y, ocasionalmente, leucita. es similar a la shoshonita, pero sin fenocristales de plagioclasa"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "absarokite"@en,
        "absarokita"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/basalt>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/basalt> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/adakita> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Acid igneous rock of dacitic or granodioritic-tonalitic composition, rich in Na2O and with high La/Yb and Sr/Y ratios (greater than 40 for the latter). Adakite may form by direct melting of subducted oceanic crust or by partial melting of a mafic crust under high-pressure conditions"@en,
        "Roca ígnea ácida, de composición dacítica o granodiorítica-tonalítica, rica en na2o y con relaciones elevadas de la/yb y sr/y mayor de 40 en este último ratio. la adakita puede formarse por fusión directa de la corteza oceánica subducida o por fusión parcial de una corteza máfica en condiciones de alta presión"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "adakite"@en,
        "adakita"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/granodiorite>,
        <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/tonalite>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/granodiorite>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/tonalite> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/agata> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Variety of chalcedony with a characteristic texture, presenting concentric zones of diverse colouration"@en,
        "Variedad de la calcedonia, de textura característica, que se presenta en zonas concéntricas de diversa coloración"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "agate"@en,
        "ágata"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/non-clasticSiliceousSedimentaryRock>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/non_clastic_siliceous_sedimentary_rock> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/aglomerado-volcanico> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Pyroclastic rock formed by more than 75% by volume of fragments with a diameter greater than 64 mm, among which volcanic bombs predominate"@en,
        "Roca piroclástica formada en más de un 75% de su volumen por fragmentos de diámetro mayor de 64 mm, entre los que predominan las bombas volcánicas"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "volcanic agglomerate"@en,
        "aglomerado volcánico"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/tuffBrecciaAgglomerateOrPyroclasticBreccia>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/tuff_breccia_agglomerate_or_pyroclastic_breccia> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/aglutinado> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Volcanic rock formed by pyroclasts that have been deposited while still hot and have been welded, flattened and plastically deformed"@en,
        "Roca volcánica formada por piroclastos que se han depositado calientes y han quedado soldados, aplastados y deformados de manera plástica"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "agglutinate"@en,
        "aglutinado"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/pyroclasticRock>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/pyroclastic_rock> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/agpaita> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Peralkaline nepheline syenite in which the agpaitic index [Na2O+K2O/Al2O3, in molar proportions] exceeds 1"@en,
        "Sienita nefelínica peralcalina en la que el índice agpaítico [na2o+k2o/al2o3, en proporciones molares] es superior a 1"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "agpaite"@en,
        "agpaíta"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/foidBearingSyenite>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/foid_bearing_syenite> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/akerita> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Microsyenite or micromonzonite rich in orthoclase and oligoclase, which may contain notable amounts of biotite and clinopyroxene, generally aegirine-augite, as well as accessory quartz"@en,
        "Microsienita o micromonzonita rica en ortosa y oligoclasa, que puede contener cantidades notables de biotita y clinopiroxeno, generalmente augita egirínica, así como cuarzo en cantidades accesorias"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "akerite"@en,
        "akerita"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/monzonite>,
        <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/syenite>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/monzonite>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/syenite> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/alabastro> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Massive variety of gypsum formed by fine-grained crystals, generally white and translucent, used in sculpture and as ornamental stone"@en,
        "Variedad masiva del yeso formada por cristales de grano fino, generalmente blanca y translúcida, que se emplea en escultura y como piedra ornamental"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "alabaster"@en,
        "alabastro"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/gypsumOrAnhydrite>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/rock_gypsum_or_anhydrite> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/alaskita> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Very leucocratic granite formed by quartz and alkali feldspars"@en,
        "Granito muy leucocrático formado por cuarzo y feldespatos alcalinos"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "alaskite"@en,
        "alaskita"@es ;
    skos:relatedMatch <http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/granite>,
        <http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/granite> ;
    skos:topConceptOf <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    adms:status "Válido" .

<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/albitita> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Igneous or metasomatic rock composed essentially of albite"@en,
        "Roca ígnea o metasomática compuesta esencialmente de albita"@es ;
    skos:inScheme <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:prefLabel "albitite"@en,
