    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Solid, naturally occurring bituminous substance composed of hydrocarbons, harder than asphalt, with a melting point between 121 and 316°C"@en,
