<https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/gabro-foidico> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-03-01"^^xsd:date ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Plutonic rock belonging to the group of foidic gabbroic rocks, in which plagioclase constitutes more than 90% of the feldspars. It is the intrusive equivalent of basanite"@en,
