    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme> ;
    skos:definition "Plutonic rock belonging to the group of foidic gabbroic rocks, in which plagioclase constitutes less than 90% of the feldspars. It is the intrusive equivalent of phonolitic basanite"@en,
